    "name": "Maze Monsters",
    "steam_appid": 2215020,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215020/extras/5e718ac6bcf096ba271a704283bb8729.avif?t=1717160130\" /></div><br>Maze Monsters is a sprawling, fast-paced 2D dungeon platformer, designed to deliver a new experience across every level. In this game, you'll travel through dark dungeons and winding mazes to face fierce monsters, lurking in wait for someone\u2014or something\u2014to draw their fury.<br><br>Choose your character from adventurous, battle-ready humans, robots, heroes, villains, and monsters of your own to set forth on a unique run to explore and discover true power. Be sure to push each unique character in combat and exploration to uncover their potential in the depths below.<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Explore the World: </strong>Warp from maze to maze, each with its own set of challenges, and face cunning (and not so cunning) monsters in quick, action-packed combat. Each environment is uniquely generated to provide a fresh experience while exploring, and features a range of potential foes, items, and powerful enhancements to collect.<br><br></li><li><strong>Choose Unique Characters to Play and Master: </strong>Pick your favorite hero, villain, machine, or monster of your own and use their abilities to push forward. Rank them up to increase their potential and unlock extras.<br><br></li><li><strong>Collect Items, Upgrades, and Powerful Abilities: </strong>Across your adventure, you'll find gold and powerful upgrades designed to develop your character. Create a specialized build to suit your playstyle, and take the fight forward.<br><br></li><li><strong>Battle Unique Enemies: </strong>Each level comes packed with ruthless and varied foes that will test your mastery of each character.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2215020/extras/5e718ac6bcf096ba271a704283bb8729.avif?t=1717160130\" /></div><br>Maze Monsters is a sprawling, fast-paced 2D dungeon platformer, designed to deliver a new experience across every level. In this game, you'll travel through dark dungeons and winding mazes to face fierce monsters, lurking in wait for someone\u2014or something\u2014to draw their fury.<br><br>Choose your character from adventurous, battle-ready humans, robots, heroes, villains, and monsters of your own to set forth on a unique run to explore and discover true power. Be sure to push each unique character in combat and exploration to uncover their potential in the depths below.<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Explore the World: </strong>Warp from maze to maze, each with its own set of challenges, and face cunning (and not so cunning) monsters in quick, action-packed combat. Each environment is uniquely generated to provide a fresh experience while exploring, and features a range of potential foes, items, and powerful enhancements to collect.<br><br></li><li><strong>Choose Unique Characters to Play and Master: </strong>Pick your favorite hero, villain, machine, or monster of your own and use their abilities to push forward. Rank them up to increase their potential and unlock extras.<br><br></li><li><strong>Collect Items, Upgrades, and Powerful Abilities: </strong>Across your adventure, you'll find gold and powerful upgrades designed to develop your character. Create a specialized build to suit your playstyle, and take the fight forward.<br><br></li><li><strong>Battle Unique Enemies: </strong>Each level comes packed with ruthless and varied foes that will test your mastery of each character.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Maze Monsters is a procedurally generated, roguelike dungeon platformer where vicious threats and dangerous foes make for an original and action-packed adventure every time.",
